      "id": "S001",
      "page": 1,
      "location": "p.1 Abstract，p.1–2 §1–2。",
      "type": "text",
      "confidence": "high",
      "original_text": "“Unlike existing shape completion methods, PCN directly operates on raw point clouds without any structural assumption (e.g. symmetry) or annotation (e.g. semantic class) about the underlying shape.”",
      "translation": "与已有形状补全方法相比，PCN 直接处理原始点云，无需对底层形状提供对称性等显式结构假设或语义类别等标注。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S002",
      "page": 2,
      "location": "p.2 §3，p.3–4 §4，p.12 App. B–C。",
      "type": "text",
      "confidence": "high",
      "original_text": "“X is not necessarily a subset of Y and there is no explicit correspondence between points in X and points in Y”",
      "translation": "输入点集 $X$ 不一定是目标点集 $Y$ 的子集，两个点集之间没有显式逐点对应。"
    },
